{
  "id": 2287,
  "title": "Forgot to bring books",
  "russian_title": "Забыл привезти́ книги",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "torfl_level": "A1",
  "hsk_tags": [
    "A1"
  ],
  "slug": "forgot-to-bring-books",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2287_forgot-to-bring-books.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A: Hello? Where are you? You didn't bring your books!",
    "B: What? Who is this?",
    "A: It's your mom! I can see your books at home. You forgot them, didn't you?",
    "B: Mom! Yes, my books are at home. I don't need to bring them today.",
    "A: Okay, got it. What do you want to eat today?",
    "B: I want rice.",
    "A: Okay, rice it is. Bye.",
    "B: Bye!"
  ],
  "english_full": "A: Hello? Where are you? You didn't bring your books!\n\nB: What? Who is this?\n\nA: It's your mom! I can see your books at home. You forgot them, didn't you?\n\nB: Mom! Yes, my books are at home. I don't need to bring them today.\n\nA: Okay, got it. What do you want to eat today?\n\nB: I want rice.\n\nA: Okay, rice it is. Bye.\n\nB: Bye!",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "А: Приве́т? Где ты? Ты не привез́ свои́ кни́ги!",
    "Б: Что? Кто это?",
    "А: Это твоя́ ма́ма! Я вижу́ твои́ кни́ги до́ма. Ты забыл́ их, не так ли?",
    "Б: Ма́ма! Да, мои́ кни́ги до́ма. Мне не надо́ их привозить́ сего́дня.",
    "А: Хорошо, понимаю́. Что ты хочешь по́есть сего́дня?",
    "Б: Я хо́чу рис.",
    "А: Хорошо, рис так рис. Пока́.",
    "Б: Пока́!"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "A: Privét? Gde ty? Ty ne priveź svoí knígi!",
    "B: Chto? Kto éto?",
    "A: Éto tvoyá máma! Ya vízhu tvói knígi dóma. Ty zabyĺ ikh, ne tak li?",
    "B: Máma! Da, moí knígi dóma. Mne ne nadó ikh privozit́ segóda.",
    "A: Khoroshó, ponimáyu. Chto ty khochesh́ poést́ segóda?",
    "B: Ya khóchu rís.",
    "A: Khoroshó, rís tak rís. Poká.",
    "B: Poká!"
  ],
